@title Example gallery: File > Examples menu
@area Examples
# The File menu with its Examples entries, then the first view right after choosing the motor control centre.
fresh
wait 10
click_text "File"
wait 8
shot file-menu
click_text "Examples"
wait 8
shot file-examples
key Escape
key Escape
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text motor control centre
wait 8
key Enter
wait 40
shot mcc-first-view
